mapping "W203.1" source="W203" target="71893005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W203 SNOMED CT 71893005 = struck by thrown/projected/falling object at a sports/athletics
        area. The W20 base code carries an Athena edge to SNOMED CT 4216727 (71893005, valid standard
        concept S, valid to 2099). The Swedish 4th char adds place (sports area). The place-specific
        SNOMED CT [X] variant 220561007 exists but is invalid (U) and cannot be used. Target 4216727 fully
        subsumes the injury-mechanism axis; place context is dropped. Broader (one axis lost); moderate
        tier because the crosswalk is verified but the source adds unspecified-place detail and the
        place-specific SNOMED CT is non-standard.
        """
}
mapping "W2030.1" source="W2030" target="71893005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2030 SNOMED CT 71893005 = W20 mechanism at a sports area while engaged in sports activity.
        W20 base maps to SNOMED CT 4216727 (Struck by falling object, S, valid). The (443786003) (57701003)
        are valid but cover activity, not mechanism+place+activity; using 4216727 alone preserves the
        mechanism axis and drops both place and activity. Broader; moderate (crosswalk verified, source
        adds two unspecified axes not separately representable by a single valid standard concept).
        """
}
mapping "W2031.1" source="W2031" target="71893005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
